{"path":"chrono/utc_clock/from_sys","title":"std::chrono::utc_clock::from_sys","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::utc_clock::</span>from_sys","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/utc_clock/from_sys","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Converts a sys_time t to a utc_time u that represents the same point in time.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Duration <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/utc_clock\"><span class=\"kw2589\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">utc_time</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/common_type\"><span class=\"kw641\">std::<span class=\"me2\">common_type_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Duration, <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1001\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">seconds</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; from_sys<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/system_clock\"><span class=\"kw2640\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sys_time</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Duration<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> t <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Converts a <code>sys_time</code> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">t</span></code> to a <code>utc_time</code> <code>u</code> that represents the same point in time.\n</p><p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">u.<span class=\"me1\">time_since_epoch</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> t.<span class=\"me1\">time_since_epoch</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is equal to the number of leap seconds that was inserted between <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">t</span></code> and 1 January 1970. If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">t</span></code> is the exact date of a leap second insertion, that leap second is counted as inserted.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A <code>utc_time</code> representing the same point in time as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">t</span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/utc_clock/to_sys\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>to_sys</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[static]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts <code>utc_time</code> to <code>sys_time</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public static member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/clock_cast\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>clock_cast</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  convert time points of one clock to another <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/utc_clock","title":"std::chrono::utc_clock"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::utc_clock::from_sys","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Converts a sys_time t to a utc_time u that represents the same point in time."},{"label":"Return value","note":"A utc_time representing the same point in time as t."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"to_sys","note":"converts utc_time to sys_time"},{"label":"clock_cast","note":"convert time points of one clock to another"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":100,"codeBlockCount":0}
